OL,3,GNEWSARenfrew Bridge to close 'for
OL,4,Amonths' after Storm Boelo damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Renfrew Bridge, which opened to
OL,7,Froad traffic across the River Clyde
OL,8,Flast year, will be closed for "a number
OL,9,Fof months" due to repair work required
OL,10,Ffollowing Storm Boelo.
OL,12,FRenfrewshire Council said electrical
OL,13,Fsystems that operate the bridge
OL,14,Fsuffered serious water damage at the
OL,15,Fweekend, with extensive damage in one
OL,16,Fof the bridge's two operating plant
OL,17,Frooms.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
